# deprecated.tflw — PLANT (tflw `M239`, `PLAN_M239_DOGFOOD_EXPANSION.md` `S-1c`): the one
# deprecation `tflw migrate` has had since `M50` — `scenario` for `test` — so the command's
# mutating half has a subject. `scripts/verify-cli-refusals.mjs` copies this file into a scratch
# project, migrates it there, and asserts the rewrite and the second run's no-op; the copy is
# what moves, and this file stays as written. Dot-directory, so discovery never picks it up.

scenario "legacy"
  api GET /v1/health
  expect status equals 200
